[{"title":"宝峰寺","author":"许当","text":"金园敞山阿，翛然隔城市。\n晨夕钟梵音，飒沓五云际。\n空山无尽香，大乘有真谛。\n簿领得馀闲，徙倚青莲地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莫公堂","author":"许当","text":"高高莫公堂，孕秀龙渊西。\n造化秘奇胜，路断无轮蹄。\n金霞烘石门，古木蟠双溪。\n中流峙鳌首，势若吞云霓。\n下招巢由隐，上揖松乔栖。\n往往春风时，桃花满深蹊。\n渔郎信波去，仙源归桨迷。\n谁结物外赏，严冬此攀跻。\n旋磨苔藓壁，更作磊落题。\n万世万斯年，岩岩穹壤齐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄檗山","author":"许当","text":"闽粤饶异山，峨峨此称奇。\n青崖蔚高林，朝日常蔽亏。\n上士访幽趣，结爱忘返期。\n所以葵藿心，江淹寄遐思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"许自诚","text":"雄当蜀道三千里，巍压荆南十五州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访景山","author":"许伯诩","text":"奉陪南极老，来慕北山名。\n凿石浓书墨，流觞款叙情。\n问谁挹仙袂，笑我缚尘缨。\n知是龙门客，终难卧孔明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆浔州廖太守四首 其四","author":"许县尉","text":"登瀛学士自瀛归，古锦囊中百政奇。\n春草池塘曾入梦，梅花厅院屡题诗。\n南州暂屈陈文惠，北斗重瞻韩退之。\n惠政三年聊复耳，斯文千载重为期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆浔州廖太守四首 其三","author":"许县尉","text":"浔江千骑拥双旌，泮水依然旧贯仍。\n不但裤襦歌惠政，更令衿佩乐师承。\n朱幡太守来何暮，绛帐先生自此升。\n预想下车先教化，再教庠序典谟兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆浔州廖太守四首 其二","author":"许县尉","text":"真儒正学久无传，酝藉如公独粹然。\n要以古人为准的，肯从馀子事拘牵。\n词源涌思流三峡，学海波澜障百川。\n灯火夜深犹不倦，口吟六艺相仍编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆浔州廖太守四首 其一","author":"许县尉","text":"昴宿储精岳降神，天教抱送玉麒麟。\n海中仙草千年实，井底丹砂百岁春。\n历运一同新甲子，日行再见旧壬辰。\n五云多处三光见，南极星中是老人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40351,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东庵广福禅院","author":"许应龙","text":"十年不到雪峰山，寂寂春风昼掩关。\n千载祖师无尽意，门前流水绿回环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40352,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代同舍上郎中 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"逸气飘飘正妙年，纵横礼乐扫三千。\n胪传玉陛星辰晓，姓字巍居鼎甲先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代同舍上郎中 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"人物依然吕洞宾，冰霜风骨玉精神。\n退朝花底千官散，标格如公有几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代同舍上郎中 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"父子同时践禁涂，一门荣耀世间无。\n愿凭曹霸丹青笔，绘入衣冠盛事图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代同舍上郎中 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"能赋人人说颍川，谁知妙诀已亲传。\n词场屡草干将句，掷地金声震九天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代同舍上郎中 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"册府方羊冠列仙，粉闱深处烂星躔。\n黄扉已设屏风隔，会见丝纶下日边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40357,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"许应龙","text":"仆诉无衣婢诉饥，老妻终日不开眉。\n十年待得齐瓜熟，又似齐瓜未熟时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40358,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤春帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"腊前三白兆年丰，即更弥旬雪满空。\n岁籥未经春已到，从今物物被和风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40359,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤春帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"一岁两逢春，皇都景物新。\n发生何处早，甲拆验庄椿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40360,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤春帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"一气转洪钧，阳和触处新。\n上林春更早，草木已精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40361,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤春帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"椒殿霞觞举，金花拆胜鲜。\n年年庆佳节，眉寿祝绵延。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40362,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤春帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"日融阆苑红初露，冰泮瑶池碧半涵。\n管取新年多胜事，当知风化自周南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40363,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤端午帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"重午宫衣赐百工，香罗叠雪葛含风。\n谁知此日荣恩被，端自称丝效茧功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40364,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤端午帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"玉切菖蒲细，金包黍角香。\n年年庆佳节，燕衎侍君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40365,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤端午帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"辟邪不用符为佩，续命何须綵结丝。\n逮下徽音继樛木，穰穰福履已来绥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40366,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤端午帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"三千玉女斗群芳，并蓄兼收百药良。\n咸愿东皇与西母，无穷眉寿等天长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40367,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇后閤端午帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"宝篆烟轻绕，瑶台日正中。\n等闲调玉瑟，聊助舜琴风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40368,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"三白从来兆岁丰，几看瑞雪舞回风。\n苍龙挂阙农祥正，击壤行歌我稼同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40369,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"宽大书方布，欢声四海同。\n阳春如有脚，造物不言功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40370,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其六","author":"许应龙","text":"东风昨夜扫氛埃，四表咸欣寿域开。\n都护已飞三捷奏，凌烟同上万年杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40371,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"金华綵胜年年巧，柏酒椒盘岁岁新。\n恭愿吾皇千万寿，四时无日不阳春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"圣德乾坤大，皇图日月长。\n远人咸畏慕，国势寖安强。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤春帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"日向皇都永，冰从太液融。\n青阳才转律，物物被和风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"诞敷文德洽寰区，赳赳明明运庙谟。\n自是不争应善胜，何须更佩辟兵符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"内外期无患，兢兢理万几。\n延英勤讲论，遑恤汗沾衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"清净无他好，歌风舞舜琴。\n阜财并解愠，总是爱民心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"离明赫赫正当中，万物咸欣长养风。\n陇麦已登蚕又熟，更多膏泽兆年丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"卑服即康功，君王俭德隆。\n却颁罗与葛，恩渥被群工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇帝閤端午帖子 其六","author":"许应龙","text":"殿阁凉生昼景长，翠烟缥渺御炉香。\n经帷讲罢看章疏，至昃犹闻食未遑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荠菜","author":"许应龙","text":"拨雪挑来叶转青，自删自煮作杯羹。\n宝阶香砌何曾识，偏向寒门满地生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤春帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"翠管银罂旧事传，新春剩喜在新年。\n巧裁綵胜迎佳节，更祝君王寿万千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤春帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"木德新回律，琼壶暖不冰。\n举头闻鹊喜，翔舞下觚棱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤春帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"月射璇题烂，风传玉漏清。\n仰瞻云汉表，辉润四星明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40384,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤春帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"贤哉淑德继鸡鸣，密赞关雎美化行。\n夙夜若为勤警戒，始终一念欲相成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40385,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤春帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"昨夜东风入律新，朝来蕙露净无尘。\n玉觞椒酒陪欢宴，总道今春胜旧春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40386,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤端午帖子 其四","author":"许应龙","text":"裁成御服进君王，雾縠云绡叠雪香。\n却效葛覃躬节用，不忘浣濯旧衣裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40387,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤端午帖子 其三","author":"许应龙","text":"丹篆钗符綵缕鲜，承恩侍宴玉皇前。\n一年一度为端午，此去应须亿万年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40388,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤端午帖子 其五","author":"许应龙","text":"槛有榴花沼有莲，南薰拂拂晚凉天。\n六宫莫度新翻曲，只理云和伴舜弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40389,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤端午帖子 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"淑德仪宫阃，天教受祉繁。\n艾人暨桃印，奚用更悬门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40390,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贵妃閤端午帖子 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"撷秀斗群芳，兼收百药良。\n不因仁及物，庶草曷蕃昌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40391,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题西岩寺 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"第一岩前风景殊，山僧去后野云孤。\n归来不费丝毫力，幻出天宫一画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40392,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题西岩寺 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"修行极则到心安，静处忙中只一般。\n谈笑打开新铺席，此身元不离蒲团。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40393,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤池立碑纪事","author":"许应龙","text":"阅尽衣冠盛事图，三魁同郡古来无。\n词科得隽真鸿笔，仙籍联荣总钜儒。\n此日姓名辉石刻，他年步武接天衢。\n浯溪更把元勋勒，藉藉休声震八区。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40394,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夫人黄氏挽诗","author":"许应龙","text":"枢庭勇退古无前，内助端由妇德贤。\n燠馆凉台供燕乐，衮衣褕翟庆联翩。\n虽云生死皆同岁，犹恨徜徉未百年。\n遥想铭旌摇曳处，江山草木亦凄然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40395,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和权郡重九韵","author":"许应龙","text":"铃斋静暇锁棠阴，幽壑何妨窈窕寻。\n咳唾珠玑辉众目，铮鏦琴瑟乐宾心。\n引杯非为黄花醉，设席欣逢皂盖临。\n来岁茱萸赐朝士，看君鲸吸玉壶斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40396,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和邹守鹿鸣宴","author":"许应龙","text":"贤守声名重泰山，肯将曲学误儒冠。\n相期素节终身履，不道青云得路难。\n多士联翩阊阖去，忠言凌厉雪霜寒。\n朱轓指日归枫禁，廷策烦公具眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40397,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽节使少保 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"一节忠勤绍祖风，貂蝉七叶擅华宗。\n版曹羡利巍迁秩，强敌知名特敛容。\n荐士半跻青琐闼，为民数奏皂囊封。\n龙旂虎节今何在，纪绩还须仗蔡邕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40398,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽李文昌 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"颙颙德望重朝廷，况有胸中千万兵。\n蛮獠未擒宵旰虑，轺车一出笑谈平。\n囊封力沮和戎议，制阃咸推料敌精。\n壮志未酬天不慭，空馀草木识威名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40399,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽李文昌 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"盛名从古号难居，公独峥嵘四纪馀。\n禁陛几年闻曳履，帅垣三度拜除书。\n寿祺合享千龄永，往事俄惊一梦如。\n久矣辱知惭未报，仰瞻丹旐倍欷歔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40400,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"馆中和赏桂诗","author":"许应龙","text":"喜陪盛集桂丛间，拟赋新诗未敢先。\n忽拜清篇真寡和，难将拙语更争妍。\n枝头烂漫黄金粟，席上风流紫府仙。\n凡骨岂容攀俊轨，也沾剩馥醉花前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40401,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潘上舍父挽诗 其二","author":"许应龙","text":"兰玉贤关隽誉飞，词场几见捷音驰。\n登云将慰椿庭望，陟岵俄惊薤露悲。\n荣养痛嗟今日隔，嘉封赖有异时追。\n前冈已卜牛眠地，螭首行镌九尺碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40402,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潘上舍父挽诗 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"狗苟蝇营笑俗情，机心降尽倒风旌。\n人生六帙不为夭，家累千金能享成。\n老去月评推吉德，生前天爵谢虚荣。\n悲风瑟瑟飞丹旐，行道歔欷亦失声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40403,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠郑枢密","author":"许应龙","text":"丘壑方将窈窕寻，肯贪斗印耀黄金。\n几颁中扆留行诏，莫返元枢勇退心。\n红旆分藩虽足乐，丹诚恋阙自难禁。\n浮云出岫知无意，祇恐苍生望更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40404,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代上何枢密","author":"许应龙","text":"宋元宪公王沂公，妙龄擢第魁南宫。\n清华历遍升谏省，雍容二府亮天工。\n却敛经纶来望郡，一镇天雄一镇郓。\n政声洋溢彻宸聪，丹诏紫泥催入觐。\n庙堂端委秉钧衡，致君尧舜风俗醇。\n至今景祐皇祐治，振荡人耳如雷霆。\n巍巍勋绩谁能继，三叹真贤生不世。\n岂知今日元枢公，矫翼天衢更凌厉。\n礼闱得隽冠群英，旋登言路撄龙鳞。\n运筹帷幄参宥密，翻私雨露泽全闽。\n生平出处总相契，左揆尚虚天有意。\n宣麻指日下彤廷，整顿乾坤迈前美。\n萱堂正富八十春，綵衣辉映衮衣新。\n二公荣贵虽同辙，如此盛事真无伦。\n先子姓名叨附骥，况复团司同典记。\n遗簪堕履傥未捐，惠顾尚期逮孙子。\n鲰生鼓箧趋贤关，朔风急劲脩涂艰。\n坱圠洪钧转一气，为借阳和先破寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40405,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代上庠同舍上廷评","author":"许应龙","text":"忆昔弱冠游芹宫，颍川先生振文风。\n跹跹媚学比如栉，抠衣执经函丈中。\n何人才识最奇伟，惟公表里圭璋粹。\n学精姬公经国书，赋飘司马凌云气。\n词场价涌荐争魁，赐也何如敢望回。\n一别星霜踰十阅，侧耳誉声轰如雷。\n翩翩荐鹗翔西浙，一飞直上黄金阙。\n排云披腹呈琅玕，蟾窟仙枝径攀折。\n枳棘难淹鸾凤栖，金科得隽易如携。\n趋归立拜廷评命，青琐黄扉指日跻。\n屈指曩年同砚席，五人已作龙门客。\n乡书黉舍多有之，碌碌未能著奇节。\n著鞭无若祖生先，策足要津仪班联。\n自笑尘踪犹隐雾，拭目亨衢问天渊。\n绨袍恋恋故人意，堕履遗簪未捐弃。\n不求而荐佩私恩，高谊如公今有几。\n虽然前事已参差，荷借邹生律再吹。\n苦无好语为公谢，抖擞枯肠成此诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40406,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张太博得余所遗二程先生集辩二程戏邵子语","author":"魏了翁","text":"文字未科斗，图书未龟龙。\n粲然天地间，此理触处逢。\n是谓象之祖，而为数之宗。\n昊牺古神圣，先得人所同。\n文因而繇之，旦出亦并雄。\n讫于我孔圣，天命滋益恭。\n浑然一理贯，密察而从容。\n辞变与象占，四者固所崇。\n推辞以知变，象占在其中。\n荒荒秦汉后，学者昧所从。\n不以灾异会，则以虚无通。\n天开周程子，易道乃复东。\n动静静复动，终始始而终。\n上承千年绪，下起百世风。\n同时有邵子，讲道于伊嵩。\n天地之运化，阴阳之无穷。\n即物验消长，先几知吉凶。\n邵子极道数，独立几无戎。\n二程自周孔，为时开梦梦。\n其归则一耳，昧者结忡忡。\n学之将柰何，矧余倍颛蒙。\n要知羲皇心，须踏周孔踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40407,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和闽帅 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"龙飞天子揽英雄，旧德欣逢泰道通。\n丹诏果然颁北阙，綵舟行矣驾东风。\n雨馀杉径新添绿，暖入花妆旋姹红。\n待得湖边春色满，我公已在凤池中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40408,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拜赐宫花纪恩诗 其一","author":"许应龙","text":"济济跄跄蔼缙绅，祝尧均效华封人。\n觞称凤阙欢声沸，花锡鸾枝内样新。\n露叶巧裁隋苑彩，天葩先借汉宫春。\n举头仰戴君恩重，好尽忠诚报紫宸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40409,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]